  "name": "Quinoa Fried Rice",
  "subtitle": "A savory skillet meal with vegetables, egg, and chilled quinoa",
  "description": "Cooked quinoa is chilled, then stir-fried with vegetables, egg, peas, and a sesame-seasoned sauce for a quick, hearty main dish.",
